1351
01:18:08,910 --> 01:18:10,250
(GRUNTS)

1352
01:18:10,510 --> 01:18:11,910
(DOOR OPENS)

1353
01:18:22,560 --> 01:18:25,737
No, we can dispense with that.
He˙s a High Court judge.

1354
01:18:26,230 --> 01:18:30,172
If he can˙t be relied on to
tell the truth, then what hope is there?

1355
01:18:31,840 --> 01:18:36,670
Sir John, some of these questions
are of a somewhat delicate,

1356
01:18:37,410 --> 01:18:38,720
