of which we are accused.

1358
01:18:41,580 --> 01:18:43,345
You are not accused, Sir John,

1359
01:18:43,650 --> 01:18:46,121
nor were you summoned
before this tribunal.

1360
01:18:46,220 --> 01:18:50,120
Well, it˙s not one hand clapping
that Mrs Mills stands accused of.

1361
01:18:50,720 --> 01:18:54,380
